      599   DEFINE BUTTON b-exit AUTO-GO
      600        LABEL "&Выход ":L
      601        SIZE 7.5 BY 1.
      602   DEFINE BUTTON b-help
      603        LABEL "Помо&щь":L
      604        SIZE 7.5 BY 1.
