      628        SIZE 97.88 BY 4.17.
      629   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-2
      630        EDGE-PIXELS 2 GRAPHIC-EDGE
      631        SIZE 19.75 BY 4.04
      632        BGCOLOR 3 FGCOLOR 15 .
      633   DEFINE RECTANGLE RECT-3
